:553104074,"text":"私は絶対に！絶対に…","nextNodeIds":[220290102]},{"nodeId":220290102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1216278490,"text":"おや？あなたは？","nextNodeIds":[220290103]},{"nodeId":220290103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3269917706,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYSECOND|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLSECOND]}の依頼を受けた。","nextNodeIds":[220290104]},{"nodeId":220290104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":937088010,"text":"あの依頼のことですか。そうです、私がお願いしました。武芸の練習相手を探しているのです。","nextNodeIds":[220290105]},{"nodeId":220290105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1149963058,"text":"私の依頼を受け取って下さったのですか？しかし、あなたとお会いしたことはないような気がします。","nextNodeIds":[220290106]},{"nodeId":220290106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":4031697282,"text":"失礼しました、実力を疑っているのではありません。ですが、あなたの武芸がどれほどのものなのか、把握できていないのです…","nextNodeIds":[220290107,220290109]},{"nodeId":220290107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2781221226,"text":"巨龍を倒したことがある。","nextNodeIds":[220290108]},{"nodeId":220290108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1433963986,"text":"ははは…本当ですか？巨龍を倒した場所の方が気になりますね。何せ、巨龍など噂でしか聞いたことがありません…","nextNodeIds":[220290112]},{"nodeId":220290112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3997196202,"text":"戦いも得意。","nextNodeIds":[220290113]},{"nodeId":220290113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1821984482,"text":"はは、武芸みたいなことは、口だけではなく、実戦で確認しないと…","nextNodeIds":[220290114,220290115]},{"nodeId":220290114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4041952362,"text":"望むところだ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220290115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2543024418,"text":"どうして匿名で依頼を出したの？","nextNodeIds":[220290116]},{"nodeId":220290116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":483095234,"text":"そ、それには…あまり大声で言えない理由がありまして…","nextNodeIds":[220290117]},{"nodeId":220290117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":2306510146,"text":"コホン、しかし依頼を受けてくれたあなたには本当のことを言いましょう。","nextNodeIds":[220290118]},{"nodeId":220290118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":3588193042,"text":"つい先日、何名かの同心と共に任務に出かけていたのですが、その帰り道で突然、商人の集団を襲撃しようとしている海乱鬼を発見しました。","nextNodeIds":[220290119]},{"nodeId":220290119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":3826476906,"text":"他の同心とともに商人を助けに向かいました。最初は我々が優勢で、海乱鬼たちはすぐに去っていきました。","nextNodeIds":[220290120]},{"nodeId":220290120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1444622330,"text":"しかし、休憩していた時、横から突然頭領らしき人物が率いる海乱鬼が現れたのです。","nextNodeIds":[220290121]},{"nodeId":220290121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":682850010,"text":"私たちは反応し切れず、不意を突かれました。","nextNodeIds":[220290122]},{"nodeId":220290122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":4119675282,"text":"勝機を失った私たちは、海乱鬼の攻撃を防ぎながら、商人たちを町へと逃がすことしか出来なかったのです。","nextNodeIds":[220290123]},{"nodeId":220290123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":2852350522,"text":"そして、海乱鬼の頭領と戦うときに…武器を奪われました。","nextNodeIds":[220290124]},{"nodeId":220290124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":3596300586,"text":"そいつはその武器を手にし、高く持ち上げ、私に向けて大笑いしました。何という屈辱…","nextNodeIds":[220290125]},{"nodeId":220290125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3307661818,"text":"商人たちはどうなったの？","nextNodeIds":[220290126]},{"nodeId":220290126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1550515482,"text":"私たちが撤退している最中、幸いにも見回り中の同心に会い、それを見た海乱鬼たちが逃げていったのです。","nextNodeIds":[220290127]},{"nodeId":220290127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":1167908394,"text":"商人たちは無事町へと護送しましたが、彼らの荷物は全て…はぁ、私が弱かったせいです…","nextNodeIds":[220290128]},{"nodeId":220290128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":2965320618,"text":"戻った後、武器を支給されました。しかし、その事をまだ無念に思っています。","nextNodeIds":[220290129]},{"nodeId":220290129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":2226932754,"text":"だからこそ、武芸を磨くために、その依頼を出したのです。","nextNodeIds":[220290130]},{"nodeId":220290130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":3803192866,"text":"十分に強くなって、自分の手であの海乱鬼を倒し武器を奪い返す。以前の屈辱を晴らすのです！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220290109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":973713002,"text":"神の死を見届けたことがある。","nextNodeIds":[220290110]},{"nodeId":220290110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":2544177170,"text":"え？それは璃月の「迎仙儀式」を見たっていうことですか？","nextNodeIds":[220290111]},{"nodeId":220290111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3060,"speakerName":"朝倉","textMapHash":4051406450,"text":"ははっ、そんなことなら、大勢の璃月人も「神の死を見届けた」ことがあると思います。","nextNodeIds":[220290112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2202901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["3060"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2202904,"order":2,"stepDescription":"朝倉と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":3600854788,